    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The five obligations",
      "prov:value": "| **visualiser** | by the HARNESS: an entry in its `<instance>.json` `visualisers` — `covers` (its directory ids) or `coversKinds`, `renderedBy` a Tool whose `renders` lists the kind — published at `<base>/<harness>/<id>/` (owner, 2026-10-09); the directory keeps only its `tile:` look | can a person LOOK at this? |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "The five obligations",
      "prov:value": "| **docs** | by the PAGE: `documents:` in its front matter (or its manifest, or `<meta name=\"documents\">` in generated HTML) names the kind or `<instance>/<id>` (#1168 B7c) | can a person READ ABOUT this? |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "The five obligations",
      "prov:value": "| **skill** | by the SKILL: `graph-typologies:` names the kind, or `governs: [<instance>/<id>]` the one directory (#1168 B7b) | is an agent handed something that GOVERNS this? |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Which kinds owe a visualiser",
      "prov:value": "The owner, 2026-09-20:\n\n> if there is active state directory in repo root/ (**not part of the static\n> KG**) like `beans/`, `todos/`, `fsh-guts/` those have their vuisalizers too\n> as requiement of handler.... needs to render sometihng for each \"state\" dir\n> it declares/inits",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The rule this is NOT, and the ten minutes that proved it",
      "prov:value": "### The rule this is NOT, and the ten minutes that proved it"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The rule this is NOT, and the ten minutes that proved it",
      "prov:value": "It covers `beans` and `todos` and **misses `fsh-guts`**, which the owner names\nin the same sentence — because bean `mhh9` reclassified `fsh-guts` from `state`\nto `context` *earlier the same day*, on the ground that no running step writes\nit: relocating something there is a human-directed act.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean mhh9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Two exemptions, and they are different shapes",
      "prov:value": "**Bootstrap is exempt by INSTANCE, not by kind.** `hfkl` carries the ruling\nthat `bootstrap` has no visualiser *\"but it must have its json/jsonld…\nthat is its existence\"*."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where a visualiser is published",
      "prov:value": "Rendered content is addressed by the three cases on bean `o7eq`:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean o7eq"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where a visualiser is published",
      "prov:value": "Case 3 is the owner's rule of 2026-10-09: *\"`<base URL>/<harness>/<visualizer>`\n(which is for the full KG) and `<base URL>/<harness>/<visualizer>/<sub-graph>`,\n`<base URL>/<harness>/<visualizer>/<sub-graph>/<path to asset>`\"*.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where a visualiser is published",
      "prov:value": "Case 3 is why `docs/` has two roles at once — the owner, asked which it was,\nanswered **\"both are right\"**."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where a visualiser is published",
      "prov:value": "The site owner's state dashboards (`/beans/`, `/todos/`, …) were drawn at the\nbare URL until 2026-10-09; they are drawn at `<base>/cat-harness/<id>/` now,\nand the bare URL is their declared alias.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where a visualiser is published",
      "prov:value": "Do not compose the\nsecond by hand — that is what produced four incompatible URL shapes across four\nopen branches on 2026-09-20.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/harness-requirements.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where a visualiser is published",
      "prov:value": "**The root's own documentation PAGES are the exception to case 1.** Owner,\n2026-10-05 (issue #2188, PR #2189, bean `kc7k`): the pages authored in\ncat-harness's `docs/` folder publish under `<base>/docs/cat-harness/` —\n`concepts/architecture.md` → `<base>/docs/cat-harness/concepts/architecture.html`,\nits locale copy at `<base>/docs/cat-harness/concepts/fr/architecture.html` —\nwith no redirects at the old addresses.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
